Exercise 16 - Identifying the Most Active Companies on the Platform

Business Problem:
The operations team wants to understand which companies are using the platform the most to publish job opportunities. 
These companies may represent important customers for future relationship strategies, support, and business opportunities.

The goal is to identify which companies have published the highest number of job postings.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT company_id, COUNT(job_id) AS Total_Postings
FROM job_postings_fact
GROUP BY company_id
ORDER BY Total_Postings DESC;


-- Business Insight:
-- The results identify the companies with the highest number of job postings,
-- showing which organizations are the most active users of the platform.
-- These companies can be prioritized for future engagement and relationship strategies.
